# Bot2's Ornithopter is exiled by Swords to Plowshares on turn 3 (no void counter), and on turn 4 Bot2 discards a Mountain
# to hand size under Dauthi Voidwalker, so it is exiled with a void counter instead. On turn 5 the Voidwalker is sacrificed:
# the Mountain is the only exiled card an opponent owns with a void counter, so there is nothing to choose and the Ornithopter
# is not offered. "Play" includes a land: Bot1 plays Bot2's Mountain from exile as its land for the turn, without
# paying anything.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Dauthi Voidwalker
Swamp
Mox Pearl
Swords to Plowshares
Swamp x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Swamp x6
Swamp
Mountain
Swamp x10

